{"id":"n26816-1-16","stage":1,"title":"나쁘다 · 不良","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26816-1-16-1","ko":"이번에 월급이 내린다는군.","zh":"听说这次工资要降低了啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번에","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"월급이","meaning":"月薪，月工资","explanation":"월급：月薪，月工资；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"월급","audio":"/audio/c384db10210a9b769d7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69619","senseId":"1","lemma":"월급","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내린다는군.","meaning":"下降，下跌；表示引用。","explanation":"내리다：下降，下跌；하다：表示引用。；ㄴ다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。；는군：对新发现或刚得知的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"내리다","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73353","senseId":"12","lemma":"내리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"c384db10210a9b76","term":"월급","zh":"月薪，月工资","audio":"/audio/c384db10210a9b769d7c.mp3","entryId":"69619","definition":"每月作为工作的回报支付的报酬。","pronunciation":["월급"]},{"id":"01d776172b3f93c3","term":"내리다","zh":"下降，下跌","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3","entryId":"73353","definition":"价格，数值或成绩等比以前下落或降低；或指这样做。","pronunciation":["내리다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a175e723996f1c494f43.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26816-1-16-2","ko":"요즘은 왜 이렇게 나쁜 소식만 들리는 거야.","zh":"最近怎么尽是些坏消息呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘은","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나쁜","meaning":"不良，坏","explanation":"나쁘다：不良，坏；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"나쁘다","audio":"/audio/b67c592bde724aa15bfa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26816","senseId":"1","lemma":"나쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소식만","meaning":"消息","explanation":"소식：消息；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"소식","audio":"/audio/648fb8dfcf63ca8c8cb6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71143","senseId":"1","lemma":"소식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들리는","meaning":"听到，传来","explanation":"들리다：听到，传来；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"들리다","audio":"/audio/f5d8f68f409d3cd71df1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70783","senseId":"1","lemma":"들리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"b67c592bde724aa1","term":"나쁘다","zh":"不良，坏","audio":"/audio/b67c592bde724aa15bfa.mp3","entryId":"26816","definition":"不好。","pronunciation":["나쁘다"]},{"id":"648fb8dfcf63ca8c","term":"소식","zh":"消息","audio":"/audio/648fb8dfcf63ca8c8cb6.mp3","entryId":"71143","definition":"告知远方的人或不常见的人的情况或状况的话或文字。","pronunciation":["소식"]},{"id":"f5d8f68f409d3cd7","term":"들리다","zh":"听到，传来","audio":"/audio/f5d8f68f409d3cd71df1.mp3","entryId":"70783","definition":"通过耳朵接受声音。","pronunciation":["들리다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/4cc503b89cc3183bcfad.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.12,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=26816","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":32,"sequenceScore":1.4117,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["听说这次工资要降低了啊。","最近怎么尽是些坏消息呢。","你经常回老家吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听说这次工资要降低了啊。","最近怎么尽是些坏消息呢。","你经常回老家吗？"],"answer":1}]}
